80007,\"slug\":\"nova-scotia-water-wastewater-operator-certification-guide\",\"title\":\"Nova Scotia Water and Wastewater Operator Certification: Requirements and Exam Preparation\",\"excerpt\":\"A practical guide to Nova Scotia water and wastewater operator certification, covering official provincial rules, ABC/WPI standardized exam requirements, a structured study plan, and an exam-day checklist.\",\"author\":\"Echelon Institute\",\"tags\":\"Nova Scotia,Water Operator Certification,Wastewater Operator Certification,WPI,ABC Exams,Exam Preparation\",\"readingTimeMinutes\":6,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-30T23:03:36.000Z\"},{\"id\":180006,\"slug\":\"retiring-operator-knowledge-transfer-utility-checklist\",\"title\":\"Your Most Experienced Operator Is Retiring. What Happens to Their Knowledge?\",\"excerpt\":\"A replacement cannot recover years of operational context. Use this practical handover sequence to identify knowledge gaps, verify records and assign owners before an experienced operator retires.\",\"author\":\"Echelon Institute\",\"tags\":\"Employer Resources,Knowledge Transfer,Utility Workforce,Succession Planning\",\"readingTimeMinutes\":6,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-03T08:23:06.000Z\"},{\"id\":180005,\"slug\":\"failed-operator-exam-what-to-change-before-retake\",\"title\":\"Failed Your Operator Exam? What to Change Before the Retake\",\"excerpt\":\"Repeating the same study method can preserve the same gaps. Learn to diagnose practice errors, keep a useful error log and assess retake readiness, with a separate explanation of Ontario's waiting rules.\",\"author\":\"Echelon Institute\",\"tags\":\"Operator Exams,Exam Retake,Study Skills,Ontario\",\"readingTimeMinutes\":5,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-03T08:23:06.000Z\"},{\"id\":180004,\"slug\":\"first-operator-job-after-oit-certification-ontario\",\"title\":\"You Have Your OIT Certificate. How Do You Get Your First Operator Job?\",\"excerpt\":\"Have a valid Ontario OIT certificate but little plant experience? Learn how to target suitable roles, describe transferable skills honestly and improve your applications.\",\"author\":\"Echelon Institute\",\"tags\":\"Ontario,OIT,Operator Careers,Job Search\",\"readingTimeMinutes\":6,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-03T08:23:06.000Z\"},{\"id\":150008,\"slug\":\"water-operator-training-programs-municipal-manager-checklist\",\"title\":\"Water Operator Training Programs: What Municipal Managers Should Look For\",\"excerpt\":\"A buyer’s checklist for evaluating operator exam-preparation platforms, including content alignment, access control, reporting, privacy, evidence, and implementation support.\",\"author\":\"Echelon Institute\",\"tags\":\"Employer Resources,Municipalities,Training Managers,Procurement,Utilities\",\"readingTimeMinutes\":8,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-11T14:41:08.000Z\"},{\"id\":150007,\"slug\":\"utilities-build-certification-ready-operator-workforce\",\"title\":\"How Utilities Can Build a Certification-Ready Operator Workforce\",\"excerpt\":\"A practical operating model for mapping licence risk, assigning study plans, supporting supervisors, and measuring workforce readiness without surveilling learners.\",\"author\":\"Echelon Institute\",\"tags\":\"Employer Resources,Utilities,Municipalities,Workforce Readiness,Training Managers\",\"readingTimeMinutes\":9,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-11T14:41:08.000Z\"},{\"id\":150006,\"slug\":\"water-operator-certification-reciprocity-canada\",\"title\":\"Water Operator Certification Reciprocity Across Canada\",\"excerpt\":\"How interprovincial recognition generally works, what Ontario’s as-of-right pathway changes, and what to verify before accepting work in another province.\",\"author\":\"Echelon Institute\",\"tags\":\"Operator Guides,Canada,Reciprocity,Certification,Career\",\"readingTimeMinutes\":8,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-11T14:41:08.000Z\"},{\"id\":150005,\"slug\":\"how-long-study-water-operator-certification-exam\",\"title\":\"How Long Should You Study for a Water Operator Certification Exam?\",